activity Detect Fraudulent Activity
activity Notify Customer
activity Decline Transaction
activity Report Suspicious Activity
activity Approve Transaction
activity Verify Customer Identity
activity Review Transaction Details
activity Investigate Security Breach
activity Implement Security Patch
activity Update Account Security
bind Detect Fraudulent Activity: Fraud Risk Level, Transaction Type, Transaction Amount
bind Notify Customer: Notification Method
bind Decline Transaction: Transaction Amount, Transaction Type
bind Report Suspicious Activity: 
bind Approve Transaction: Transaction Amount, Transaction Type
bind Verify Customer Identity: Verification Attempt, Verification Status
bind Review Transaction Details: Transaction Amount, Transaction Type
bind Investigate Security Breach: Breach Severity
bind Implement Security Patch: Security Patch Status
bind Update Account Security: 
Transaction Type: Debit, Credit, Wire Transfer, Online Payment
Transaction Amount: float between 0.01 and 100000.0
Fraud Risk Level: Low, Medium, High
Verification Attempt: integer between 1 and 5
Verification Status: Verified, Not Verified, Pending
Breach Severity: integer between 1 and 10
Security Patch Status: Applied, Not Applied, Scheduled
Notification Method: Email, SMS, Phone Call
Days Since Last Activity: integer between 0 and 365
Absence5[Detect Fraudulent Activity] | |
Response[Detect Fraudulent Activity, Notify Customer] | | |
Chain Response[Detect Fraudulent Activity, Decline Transaction] |A.Fraud Risk Level is High | |0,5,m
Response[Decline Transaction, Report Suspicious Activity] | | |
Precedence[Approve Transaction, Verify Customer Identity] | | |
Chain Precedence[Verify Customer Identity, Review Transaction Details] |A.Transaction Amount > 1000 | |0,10,m
Response[Investigate Security Breach, Implement Security Patch] |A.Breach Severity > 7 | |0,48,h
Response[Investigate Security Breach, Implement Security Patch] | | |
Response[Implement Security Patch, Implement Security Patch] |A.Security Patch Status is Not Applied | |0,7,d
Response[Notify Customer, Update Account Security] |A.Notification Method is SMS | |0,24,h
Response[Notify Customer, Update Account Security] | | |